## 15. Key Methodological Corrections from v7

| Issue | v7 (wrong) | v8 (corrected) |
|---|---|---|
| HCC universe | 387 (treatment candidates only) | **3,999** (all REACH) |
| TKI capture | sorafenib=2, lenvatinib=2, cabo=1 | sorafenib=**90**, lenvatinib=**165**, cabo=**76** |
| "Systemic doxorubicin" | 119 patients | **5** truly systemic, 865 TACE-associated |
| Hospitalizations | Median 38 (encounter rows) | Median **8** (unique admissions) |
| IV drug source | med_admin (sparse) | **med_orders** (primary) |
| Combo identification | Same-day med_admin pairs (0 results) | **Beacon plans + med_orders** |
| AFP coverage | \~80% missing (v5) / 69% (v7) | **60.5%** ever measured (all HCC) |
